@startuml
!include ../../../../../../tooling/styles/plantuml/structural/component-diagram-style.iuml

title Basic Layered Architecture\nHigher layers depend on lower layers; never the reverse

rectangle "<<Layer N>>\n**Presentation Layer**\nUser interface, views, controllers" as L4 $fill_primary
rectangle "<<Layer N-1>>\n**Application Layer**\nUse cases, workflows, coordination" as L3 $fill_ok
rectangle "<<Layer N-2>>\n**Domain Layer**\nBusiness rules, domain entities" as L2 $fill_caution
rectangle "<<Layer 1>>\n**Foundation / Infrastructure Layer**\nPersistence, utilities, platform abstractions" as L1 $fill_alt

L4 -[$line_primary]-> L3 : <<allowed-to-use>>
L3 -[$line_primary]-> L2 : <<allowed-to-use>>
L2 -[$line_primary]-> L1 : <<allowed-to-use>>

legend right
  | Color | Layer Role |
  |<$fill_primary>  | Presentation / UI |
  |<$fill_ok>  | Application |
  |<$fill_caution>  | Domain |
  |<$fill_alt>  | Foundation / Infrastructure |
end legend

note right of L4
  Dependencies flow
  **downward only**.
  Each layer provides
  services to the
  layer above.
end note
@enduml
